      "name": "MakeFull",
      "category": "UncheckedArray",
      "signature": "MakeFull()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "TCArray<T,N>",
      "docs": "@brief A c-style array of objects with non-shipping bounds checking.\nThis behaves exactly like a C-style array, although it also keeps track of the number of\nelements in the array. This element count is artficial - all elements in the array are\ndefault constructed and will not be destructed until the array itself is destroyed.\n@note the element type must have a default constructor"
